      "lineHeight": "60px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
    },
    {
      "text": "因为您的产品上市时间至关重要",
      "tag": "STRONG",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724143352",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "30px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "60px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "LBH电器深知时间对您的业务至关重要，也明白及时了解生产流程对于您品牌决策的重要性。",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724143352",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "14px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "28px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "因此，我们会在您下单后为您配备专属项目经理，随时向您汇报定制新产品项目的进展情况。",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724143352",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "14px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "28px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "轻松了解每笔订单的进度",
      "tag": "STRONG",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724143351",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "30px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "60px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "从您的专属联系人处获取反馈：",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720546556",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "微软雅黑",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "21.328px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "始终密切关注合同进展，定期获得反馈，以便对正在进行和未来的项目进行修改和实施。",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720546556",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "微软雅黑",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "21.328px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "获取生产进度通知：",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720546544",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "微软雅黑",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "21.328px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "我们的项目经理会根据您的要求，向您提供项目的最新通知，让您随时了解项目的进展情况。",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720546544",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "微软雅黑",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "21.328px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "请提出您的建议：",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720546558",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "微软雅黑",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "21.328px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "通过您宝贵的见解和建议，帮助我们在产品项目中追求卓越的制造工艺；打造您专业的个护家电产品。",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720546558",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "微软雅黑",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "21.328px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "让我们今天联系，寻找正确的解决方案！",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720546151",
      "main": true,
